{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"25d5b55e-0df7-4a9a-927f-a0b00d515c51","status":"SUCCESS","response":"{\n  \"doc_id\": \"seeded_lms\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-005\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_condition\",\n      \"evidence\": \"lock a Member account after 5 consecutive failed login attempts within a 10-minute window\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Does not specify the lockout duration, the unlock condition or recovery mechanism (automatic timeout vs. administrative unlock), or the error response returned to the locked-out Member.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-006\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"referential\",\n      \"evidence\": \"notify him by email\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"The pronoun 'him' has an ambiguous antecedent and could refer to the Librarian, the Member, or the Guarantor.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-007\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"tbd\",\n      \"evidence\": \"TBD minutes\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Contains an unresolved 'TBD' placeholder instead of a concrete token expiration duration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-008\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"vague_term\",\n      \"evidence\": \"user-friendly; easy to navigate; loads rapidly; standard connections\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses subjective, unquantified terms without measurable usability criteria, load-time thresholds, or network bandwidth definitions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-012\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"tbd\",\n      \"evidence\": \"TBD consecutive times\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Contains an unresolved 'TBD' placeholder instead of specifying the maximum number of consecutive loan renewals.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-013\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"validate item eligibility within 2 seconds and issue the loan receipt\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Specifies only the successful checkout path and omits error handling for ineligible items, invalid or unreadable barcodes, or validation failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-014\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_value_or_unit\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the allowed maximum number of active hold requests\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"References an allowed maximum number of active hold requests without defining the actual numeric limit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-015\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_values\",\n      \"evidence\": \"borrow up to 8 physical items simultaneously\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\"SD-009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Allows a Member in good standing to borrow up to 8 physical items simultaneously, contradicting SD-009 which caps simultaneous checkouts at 5 physical items.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-016\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_values\",\n      \"evidence\": \"21 calendar days from the checkout timestamp\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\"SD-010\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Sets the standard loan period for circulating print books to 21 calendar days, contradicting SD-010 which sets it to 14 calendar days.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-017\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_rules\",\n      \"evidence\": \"self-register online with only an email address and immediately check out physical books without Librarian ID verification\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\"SD-001\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Permits unverified visitors to self-register with only an email address and check out books without ID verification, contradicting SD-001 which requires a Librarian to verify government-issued photo ID and record full name, email, and phone number.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-018\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_rules\",\n      \"evidence\": \"remain held indefinitely until the requesting Member explicitly cancels the hold\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\"SD-011\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"States that reserved items on the pickup shelf are held indefinitely until explicitly cancelled by the Member, contradicting SD-011 which requires automatic cancellation after exactly 72 hours.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-021\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"coordination\",\n      \"evidence\": \"send an overdue email and/or suspend borrowing privileges and/or apply a penalty flag\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses chained 'and/or' conjunctions without specifying which exact combination of the three actions must be executed or under what conditions each applies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-022\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_actor\",\n      \"evidence\": \"shall be reviewed, approved, and recorded\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses passive voice without identifying which actor or role (e.g., Librarian, Administrator, Billing Service) is responsible for reviewing, approving, and recording fine waiver requests; it also omits handling for rejections or requests above $25.00 USD.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-023\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"weak_phrase\",\n      \"evidence\": \"before the due date if appropriate\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"The weak phrase 'if appropriate' leaves the condition for dispatching SMS alerts subjective and untestable, and 'before the due date' does not specify a concrete lead time